    old "Alright, now bend over on the desk and grab the edges real right."
    new "Bene, ora piegati sulla scrivania e afferra bene i bordi."

    old "Again, Sarah obeyed his instructions."
    new "Ancora una volta, Sarah obbedì alle sue istruzioni."

    old "Some women tell me this hurts, but ya know, others are fine with it. I guess it's a matter of how experienced they are with it."
    new "Alcune donne mi dicono che fa male, ma sai, altre se la cavano bene. Immagino dipenda da quanto esperienza ne hanno."

    old "Sarah felt a sharp pain explode from her ass."
